# mod-custom-spells: the Druid spells of the concept revision of 2026-10-08
# (share-public custom-spells/09-concept-revision-20261008.md) on a bot. Every
# check states the revised concept, so a FAIL marks a defect, not a typo.
# (901002 Starfall area +50 % is checked in cs_druid, where its old check was.)
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018: take 0 damage, never die, the combat log still reads the full
# amount; each one faces the ring's middle) on a 3.9-yd circle around
# (-270, 150); d1 = the west-most one (-273.9, 150), facing east.
# Killable and attacking enemies are summoned by the director 40 yd north of
# the ring (-279, 190: outside every area the cs_* scenarios use; map 13 has no
# terrain there, server-side a unit simply stands at the given height) with
# `.npc add temp` (they despawn once dead): Mindless Zombies (1501, level 1)
# for killing blows, a Designer Island Sabercat (23014, level 30, about 1,400
# health, melee only, no spells) for hits taken - Growl (6795) makes it attack
# the druid. The director selects the sabercat as soon as it exists and kills
# that selection with `.die` when done (a sabercat that died meanwhile leaves
# nothing to kill: `.die` then only answers with an error).
# Hit rolls: Song of Sylvanas 59756 (no miss), NPC Hit Buffs 62627 (no dodge or
# parry) and 64481 (no crit) on the druid where a roll would decide a check.
# Spells: Moonfire 48463, Moonkin Form 24858 (talent), Starfire 48465 (rank
# 10), Dire Bear Form 9634, Growl 6795, Swipe (Bear) 48562 (20 rage), Lacerate
# 48568 (a bleed), Thorns 53307, Barkskin 22812, Cat Form 768, Swipe (Cat)
# 62078, Shred 48572 (needs you behind the target), Mangle (Cat) 48566 (a
# combo point), Ferocious Bite 48577 (a finisher), Berserk 50334 (talent).
# New: 901006 Lunar Frenzy (buff 901007), 901036 Swipe (Bear) +50 %, 901037
# Thorns: Open Wounds (901038), 901039 Ursine Bulwark (buff 901040, burst
# 901041), 901052 Swipe (Cat) +50 %, 901053 Frontal Assault, 901054 Berserk:
# Unleashed (speed 901055, burst 901056).
name    Custom spells - Druid revision 2026-10-08
timeout 300s

bot dr druid slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require dr alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near dr
require d1 exists
do gm target dr
as gm .unlearn 901006
as gm .unlearn 901036
as gm .unlearn 901037
as gm .unlearn 901039
as gm .unlearn 901052
as gm .unlearn 901053
as gm .unlearn 901054
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
as gm .unaura 901007
as gm .unaura 901040
as gm .unaura 901055
as gm .unaura 24858
as gm .unaura 9634
as gm .unaura 768
do dr learn 48463
do dr learn 24858
do dr learn 48465
do dr learn 9634
do dr learn 6795
do dr learn 48562
do dr learn 48568
do dr learn 53307
do dr learn 768
do dr learn 62078
do dr learn 48572
do dr learn 48566
do dr learn 48577
do dr learn 50334
as gm .aura 59756
as gm .aura 62627
as gm .aura 64481
waitfor dr aura 64481 timeout 2s

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Balance
log Balance - 901006 Lunar Frenzy, control: a killing blow outside Moonkin Form gives no stack (a Mindless Zombie, one Moonfire)
do dr learn 901006
do gm goto -279 190 -423.2
do dr goto -279 182 -423.2
wait 500ms
as gm .npc add temp 1501
pick z1 creature:1501 near gm
require z1 exists
do dr approach z1 8
do dr cast 48463 on z1 triggered
wait 800ms
expect dr noaura 901007

log Balance - 901006 in Moonkin Form every killing blow adds a stack of 901007 (+1 % damage and haste): two zombies, two stacks
do dr cast 24858 triggered
wait 500ms
as gm .npc add temp 1501
pick z2 creature:1501 near gm
require z2 exists
do dr approach z2 8
do dr cast 48463 on z2 triggered
wait 800ms
as gm .npc add temp 1501
pick z3 creature:1501 near gm
require z3 exists
do dr approach z3 8
do dr cast 48463 on z3 triggered
wait 800ms
expect dr aurastacks 901007 == 2

log Balance - 901006 at 100 stacks a free instant Starfire (48465, the highest rank known) goes off at a random enemy in front of the druid within range every 3 s while it fights: 7 s at the ring (Moonfire on d1 keeps the fight going)
do gm goto -279 150 -423.2
do dr goto -294 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do dr approach d1 20
wait 300ms
as gm .aura stack 901007 98
expect dr aurastacks 901007 == 100
spelllog start
do dr cast 48463 on d1 triggered
wait 7s
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 48465 casts >= 1
expect dr spell 48465 casts <= 3
expect dr spell 48465 hits >= 1
as gm .unaura 901007
as gm .unaura 24858
as gm .unlearn 901006

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Feral tank
log Feral tank - 901036 Swipe (Bear) +50 %
do dr learn 901036
expect dr spellmod 48562 damage 100 == 150
as gm .unlearn 901036

log Feral tank - 901039 Ursine Bulwark: hits taken in Bear Form stack 901040 (+1 % maximum health) - a sabercat taunted onto the druid in Dire Bear Form
do dr learn 901039
do dr cast 9634 triggered
do gm goto -279 190 -423.2
do dr goto -279 186 -423.2
wait 500ms
as gm .npc add temp 23014
pick sab1 creature:23014 near gm
require sab1 exists
do gm target sab1
do dr approach sab1
do dr cast 6795 on sab1 triggered
waitfor dr aura 901040 timeout 15s
expect dr aurastacks 901040 >= 1
as gm .die
do gm target dr

log Feral tank - 901039 at 100 stacks Barkskin (22812) stays up for as long as Ursine Bulwark lasts (longer than its own 12 s)
as gm .aura stack 901040 99
expect dr aurastacks 901040 == 100
waitfor dr aura 22812 timeout 3s
expect dr auraduration 22812 > 12000

log Feral tank - 901039 at 100 stacks every 100 rage spent sets off Ursine Quake (901041) round the druid: five normal Swipes (20 rage each) in the ring's middle, the rage refilled before each
do gm goto -279 150 -423.2
do dr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
spelllog start
as gm .modify rage 100
do dr cast 48562
wait 1600ms
as gm .modify rage 100
do dr cast 48562
wait 1600ms
as gm .modify rage 100
do dr cast 48562
wait 1600ms
as gm .modify rage 100
do dr cast 48562
wait 1600ms
as gm .modify rage 100
do dr cast 48562
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 48562 casts == 5
expect dr spell 901041 casts == 1
expect dr spell 901041 targets >= 6
as gm .unaura 901040
as gm .unaura 22812
as gm .unlearn 901039

log Feral tank - 901037 Thorns: Open Wounds: a bleeding attacker struck back by the druid's Thorns takes 901038 (Physical, 666 + 5 x the Paragon level, a bleed: no armor), at most once every 5 s - a sabercat with Lacerate, taunted onto the druid, about 6 s of its swings
do dr learn 901037
do dr cast 53307 on dr triggered
do gm goto -279 190 -423.2
do dr goto -279 186 -423.2
wait 500ms
as gm .npc add temp 23014
pick sab2 creature:23014 near gm
require sab2 exists
do gm target sab2
do dr approach sab2
do dr cast 48568 on sab2 triggered
do dr cast 6795 on sab2 triggered
spelllog start
waitfor dr spell 901038 hits >= 1 timeout 20s
wait 6s
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 901038 damage >= 600
expect dr spell 901038 hits <= 2
as gm .die
do gm target dr
as gm .unaura 53307
as gm .unaura 9634
as gm .unlearn 901037

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Feral DPS
log Feral DPS - 901052 Swipe (Cat) +50 %
do dr learn 901052
expect dr spellmod 62078 damage 100 == 150
as gm .unlearn 901052

log Feral DPS - control: Shred (48572) from in front of d1 (it faces the ring's middle) is refused: "must be behind" (SpellCastResult 57)
do gm goto -279 150 -423.2
do dr goto -270.5 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do dr approach d1 1.5
wait 300ms
do dr cast 768 triggered
wait 500ms
do dr reset
do dr clientcast 48572 on d1
expect output has "result 57"

log Feral DPS - 901053 Frontal Assault: the same Shred from the front goes through
do dr learn 901053
do dr reset
spelllog start
do dr clientcast 48572 on d1
expect output lacks "cast failed"
wait 500ms
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 48572 casts == 1
as gm .unlearn 901053

log Feral DPS - 901054 Berserk: Unleashed: while Berserk (50334) lasts +100 % movement speed (901055, Berserk's duration)
do dr learn 901054
do dr reset
do dr cast 50334 triggered
wait 300ms
expect dr aura 901055
expect dr auraduration 901055 > 10000

log Feral DPS - 901054 a 5-combo-point finisher unleashes 901056 (Physical round the druid): five Mangles (a point each), then a Ferocious Bite on d1
do dr cast 48566 on d1 triggered
do dr cast 48566 on d1 triggered
do dr cast 48566 on d1 triggered
do dr cast 48566 on d1 triggered
do dr cast 48566 on d1 triggered
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do dr cast 48577 on d1
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 48577 hits >= 1
expect dr spell 901056 casts == 1
expect dr spell 901056 targets >= 6

log Feral DPS - 901054 a 4-point finisher unleashes nothing
do dr cast 48566 on d1 triggered
do dr cast 48566 on d1 triggered
do dr cast 48566 on d1 triggered
do dr cast 48566 on d1 triggered
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do dr cast 48577 on d1
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 48577 hits >= 1
expect dr spell 901056 casts == 0

log Feral DPS - 901054 the speed goes with Berserk
as gm .unaura 50334
waitfor dr noaura 901055 timeout 2s
as gm .unlearn 901054

cleanup
do dr stop
do gm goto -279 150 -423.2
do gm target dr
as gm .unaura 901007
as gm .unaura 901040
as gm .unaura 901055
as gm .unaura 50334
as gm .unaura 22812
as gm .unaura 53307
as gm .unaura 24858
as gm .unaura 9634
as gm .unaura 768
as gm .unaura 59756
as gm .unaura 62627
as gm .unaura 64481
as gm .unlearn 901006
as gm .unlearn 901036
as gm .unlearn 901037
as gm .unlearn 901039
as gm .unlearn 901052
as gm .unlearn 901053
as gm .unlearn 901054
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
